capability route/not-found  the answer for a path no route takes
  heroes  web.not_routed
  go      echo.NotFoundHandler, echo.Echo.RouteNotFound, gin.Engine.NoRoute, chi.Mux.NotFound, net/http.NotFound, net/http.NotFoundHandler
