capability route/method-not-allowed  405 and the methods allowed for a path whose routes take other methods
  heroes  web.not_routed, web.allowed_of
  go      echo.MethodNotAllowedHandler, gin.Engine.NoMethod, gin.Engine.HandleMethodNotAllowed, chi.Mux.MethodNotAllowed, net/http.ServeMux's 405
  rust    -
