capability static/range  part of a file answered
  heroes  web.serve_file, web.serve_folder
  go      net/http.ServeContent's Range and If-Range
  rust    -
  python  -
  note    one range 206, unsatisfiable ones dropped (`bytes=20-,0-1` gives `0-1`), none left 416 with `Content-Range: bytes */N`, a range that does not read 416, as Go (observed); several left answered whole 200, where Go writes multipart/byteranges; `bytes=-0` 416, where Go answers 206 `bytes 11-10/11` (observed) and RFC 9110 § 14.1.2 calls it unsatisfiable; a unit other than bytes ignored, as RFC 9110 § 14.2 allows, where Go answers 416

