capability middleware/timeout  a handler stopped past a time
  heroes  refused: a handler runs to its end on the thread that serves, and the language has no way to stop a function midway (spec § 13 joins a thread, never cancels one), so a step could answer late but never stop the work; `http.Server.deadline_ms` bounds a connection instead
  go      echo/middleware.Timeout, echo/middleware.ContextTimeout, chi/middleware.Timeout, net/http.TimeoutHandler
  rust    -
  python  -

